{"batchcomplete": "", "query": {"pages": {"114452582": {"pageid": 114452582, "ns": 6, "title": "File:New SA80 A3 Assault Rifle MOD 45163882.jpg", "imagerepository": "local", "imageinfo": [{"size": 453663, "width": 4582, "height": 2205, "thumburl": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/New_SA80_A3_Assault_Rifle_MOD_45163882.jpg/1920px-New_SA80_A3_Assault_Rifle_MOD_45163882.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "thumbwidth": 1600, "thumbheight": 770, "responsiveUrls": {"2": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/New_SA80_A3_Assault_Rifle_MOD_45163882.jpg/3840px-New_SA80_A3_Assault_Rifle_MOD_45163882.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"}, "thumbattribs": {"src": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/New_SA80_A3_Assault_Rifle_MOD_45163882.jpg/1920px-New_SA80_A3_Assault_Rifle_MOD_45163882.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "decoding": "async", "loading": "lazy", "width": 1600, "height": 770, "srcset": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/New_SA80_A3_Assault_Rifle_MOD_45163882.jpg/3840px-New_SA80_A3_Assault_Rifle_MOD_45163882.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"}, "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/New_SA80_A3_Assault_Rifle_MOD_45163882.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "descriptionurl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:New_SA80_A3_Assault_Rifle_MOD_45163882.jpg", "descriptionshorturl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=114452582", "extmetadata": {"DateTime": {"value": "2022-04-29 16:01:35", "source": "mediawiki-metadata", "hidden": ""}, "ObjectName": {"value": "New SA80 A3 Assault Rifle MOD 45163882", "source": "mediawiki-metadata"}, "CommonsMetadataExtension": {"value": 1.2, "source": "extension", "hidden": ""}, "Categories": {"value": "OGL v3.0|Images from Defence Imagery|L85A3|Rifles on white background|ELCAN Specter", "source": "commons-categories", "hidden": ""}, "Assessments": {"value": "", "source": "commons-categories", "hidden": ""}, "ImageDescription": {"value": "Pictured is the new SA80 A3 Assault Rifle.The current issue SA80 A2 assault weapon is being upgraded into the A3 spec under the Mid Life Improvement (MLI) project, which will ensure the rifle has the enhancements needed to remain in service until 2025 and beyond.This multi-million-pound upgrade will give British troops a lighter, more hardwearing, better-camouflaged combat rifle so our personnel can perform on the frontline of some of the most dangerous locations across the world.The changes to the rifle include a more durable hardwearing coating in a\u201cFlat Dark Earth\u201d colour offering better camouflage in a range of environments.A weight saving of 100g over the A2, and a more streamlined fore grip making the weapon easier to handle.The A3 rifle has a bracket to secure new innovative low light sights which can clip on or in front of the day sight without the need to remove it.These sights are smaller, lighter and require fewer batteries whilst operating just as effectively in low light/night conditions.", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "DateTimeOriginal": {"value": "2015-02-26 13:10:59", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Credit": {"value": "<p>Photo: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.defenceimagery.mod.uk/Home/Search?Query=45163882.jpg&amp;Type=Filename\">https://www.defenceimagery.mod.uk/Home/Search?Query=45163882.jpg&amp;Type=Filename</a>\n</p>\nMetadata source: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.defenceimagery.mod.uk/fotoweb/fwbin/fotoweb_isapi.dll/ArchiveAgent/5042/Search?FileInfo=1&amp;MetaData=1&amp;Search=45163882.jpg\">http://www.defenceimagery.mod.uk/fotoweb/fwbin/fotoweb_isapi.dll/ArchiveAgent/5042/Search?FileInfo=1&amp;MetaData=1&amp;Search=45163882.jpg</a>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Artist": {"value": "Graeme Main", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "LicenseShortName": {"value": "OGL 3", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "UsageTerms": {"value": "Open Government License 3", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "AttributionRequired": {"value": "true", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "Attribution": {"value": "Photo: Graeme Main/UK Ministry of Defence 2021", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "LicenseUrl": {"value": "http://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Copyrighted": {"value": "True", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "Restrictions": {"value": "", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}}}]}, "116190856": {"pageid": 116190856, "ns": 6, "title": "File:Royal Artillery Sky Sabre system.jpg", "imagerepository": "local", "imageinfo": [{"size": 1571683, "width": 7646, "height": 5461, "thumburl": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/34/Royal_Artillery_Sky_Sabre_system.jpg/1920px-Royal_Artillery_Sky_Sabre_system.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "thumbwidth": 1600, "thumbheight": 1143, "responsiveUrls": {"2": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/34/Royal_Artillery_Sky_Sabre_system.jpg/3840px-Royal_Artillery_Sky_Sabre_system.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"}, "thumbattribs": {"src": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/34/Royal_Artillery_Sky_Sabre_system.jpg/1920px-Royal_Artillery_Sky_Sabre_system.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "decoding": "async", "loading": "lazy", "width": 1600, "height": 1143, "srcset": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/34/Royal_Artillery_Sky_Sabre_system.jpg/3840px-Royal_Artillery_Sky_Sabre_system.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"}, "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/34/Royal_Artillery_Sky_Sabre_system.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "descriptionurl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Royal_Artillery_Sky_Sabre_system.jpg", "descriptionshorturl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=116190856", "extmetadata": {"DateTime": {"value": "2022-03-18 18:57:49", "source": "mediawiki-metadata", "hidden": ""}, "ObjectName": {"value": "Royal Artillery Sky Sabre system", "source": "mediawiki-metadata"}, "CommonsMetadataExtension": {"value": 1.2, "source": "extension", "hidden": ""}, "Categories": {"value": "OGL v1.0|Sky Sabre|Royal Artillery|Photos by User:TheArmchairSoldier|MAN HX77|Giraffe AMB", "source": "commons-categories", "hidden": ""}, "Assessments": {"value": "", "source": "commons-categories", "hidden": ""}, "ImageDescription": {"value": "Pictured are 16th Regiment, The Royal Regiment of Artillery soldiers demonstrating the Sky Sabre Air defence missile system.Left to right, Radar Targeting System Vehicle with the 'Giraffe' Radar deployed,Command and Control Vehicle and the Missile Launcher Vehicle housing the CAMM (Common Anti-Air Modular Missiles).British Army has taken delivery of its brand new state-of-the-art intermediate air defence system, Sky Sabre.It marks a wholesale upgrade to the venerable Rapier system that has now been in service for nearly five decades. Sky Sabre, comprising of three separate components:1) The Agile Multi-Beam surveillance radar (affectionally referred to as the Giraffe,2) The Battle Management Command&amp;Control Communications centre.3) The Land Ceptor missile delivery vehicle. (All are pictured together for the purposes of the photographs; on the battlefield they could be expected to operate up to 15Km apart).The system has the ability to engage multiple targets simultaneously and can take out aircraft, drones and even laser guided bombs at a range of 120Km using the CAMM (Common Anti-Air Modular Missile) travelling at over 2300 miles per hour.", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "DateTimeOriginal": {"value": "2021-11-04 11:31:41", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Credit": {"value": "<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.defenceimagery.mod.uk/\">https://www.defenceimagery.mod.uk/</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20220324200058/https://www.defenceimagery.mod.uk/Home/Search?Query=105%3ASky+Sabre+Air+defence+missile+system&amp;Type=Metadata&amp;Search=Sky+Sabre+Air+defence+missile+system\">archived source</a>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Artist": {"value": "Ministry of Defence", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "LicenseShortName": {"value": "OGL v1.0", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "UsageTerms": {"value": "Open Government License version 1.0", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "AttributionRequired": {"value": "true", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "LicenseUrl": {"value": "http://NationalArchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/1/", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Copyrighted": {"value": "True", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "Restrictions": {"value": "", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}}}]}, "107552204": {"pageid": 107552204, "ns": 6, "title": "File:Syst\u00e8me SAMP-T (14 juillet 2021) (1).jpg", "imagerepository": "local", "imageinfo": [{"size": 2995116, "width": 4000, "height": 3000, "thumburl": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/Syst%C3%A8me_SAMP-T_%2814_juillet_2021%29_%281%29.jpg/1920px-Syst%C3%A8me_SAMP-T_%2814_juillet_2021%29_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "thumbwidth": 1600, "thumbheight": 1200, "responsiveUrls": {"2": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/Syst%C3%A8me_SAMP-T_%2814_juillet_2021%29_%281%29.jpg/3840px-Syst%C3%A8me_SAM